/T (A student, after completing one year of Biological Sciences, transfers to the Economics and Business program. Although this student is attending the first year of the Economics and Business course, their year of initial enrollment is the previous one; therefore, regarding the right to study, they will be classified as a second-year student, and the required merit criteria will be those applicable to the second year.)
/E (A student, after completing one year of Biological Sciences, transfers to the Economics and Business program. Although this student is attending the first year of the Economics and Business course, their year of initial enrollment is the previous one; therefore, regarding the right to study, they will be classified as a second-year student, and the required merit criteria will be those applicable to the second year.)
