/E (Screening semester Students enrolling in the "screening semester" for the 2025/2026 academic year must submit their scholarship application by August 26, 2025. It is recommended to apply to all the student support agencies responsible for the locations you intend to select, while paying close attention to the deadlines of the various calls for applications.)
