860 0 obj
<<
/Title (REPRESENTATION We are student representatives and have been the University's leading party for 30 years. We engage in university politics without identifying with a national party, always protecting the interests of the students within University. The core principles of our work are: the protection of the right to education, the fight against all forms of discrimination, anti-fascism, and anti-racism. With our daily presence in the Faculty Halls and on social media, we are always available to receive feedback and suggestions, provide information, and assist with the complicated university bureaucracy, as well as discuss university affairs, current events, and politics.)
