/Title (Students enrolled in years beyond the first The benefit for years subsequent to the first is awarded based on academic merit already achieved. However, students forfeit their eligibility if any of the following conditions occur: Submission of a formal request to withdraw from studies or to transfer to another university during the academic year, prior to the deadlines specified in the call for applications. Verification that the self-declarations submitted \(regarding ISEE/ISPE or study program status\) are untrue.)
