/Title (To further worsen this already dramatic picture, there is the reform of the filter semester, presented as an opening and a sign of inclusion, but which has turned out, in reality, in yet another hypocritical and purely propagandistic measure. The limited number, in fact, has not been abolished, but simply postponed, turning into a deferred selection that has worsened the condition of thousands of students.)
